{"data":{"body":"[P2] Copy configuration without repeating provider discovery. With `DURABLE_EXECUTION_PLUGINS=otel-invocation`, `config.getPluginFactories()` already contains the selected provider. This fresh builder discovers it again, so `build()` rejects the duplicate exclusive group; ungrouped providers instead receive duplicate registrations. Use `config.toBuilder()` and update the surrounding explanation to match the actual `LocalDurableTestRunner` copy path.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-PNFg","finding_digest":"c22ec9cfe3d2d120e74de710907177d5e44b8f464fc3c25db071141f4714b39c","finding_id":"arf_v1_yixmtt7d2lisbz2n44ija4lx2x","finding_key":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.x.md::configuration-copy-example::duplicate-provider-discovery","identity_key":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.x.md::configuration-copy-example::duplicate-provider-discovery","line":245,"observation_digest":"a249c6a8fc15feeedd71e2388389281ebbbc0521c3e1232d8088f77b82e8e3c1","observation_id":"aro_v1_uje4nkh4cx7o5xlr4i4ihcjid2","path":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.x.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T00:07:58Z","review_id":"arr_v1_o5fiotbocey4z2j7ppcyr2b4a7","reviewed_base_sha":"4c8f469dc61ef76bd1a6cfdd757720a9f22b9363","reviewed_head_sha":"cf82d12ca84466d648534297494b11f6db07bdb2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":243,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_4gwfb22wd7j4ojhtpdwvanp4pk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T00:07:58Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
